WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.232
Tap Sales, then Estimates.

00:00:03.232 --> 00:00:11.624
Tap + New Estimate. For an order, tap + New Order instead. Everything after this works the same.

00:00:11.624 --> 00:00:15.312
Tap Select Customer, and pick the customer.

00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:19.312
Brand new customer? Tap the plus at the right of the box.

00:00:19.312 --> 00:00:26.960
Type their name and company, and a phone number or email, then tap Create & Select. They are now picked in the box.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:34.560
Now type the Estimate Description. This is the name of the job that everyone will see, so keep it short and in ALL CAPS.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:43.192
Say what the job is. For a 4 by 8 foot Now Opening banner, type: 4X8 FT NOW OPENING BANNER.

00:00:43.192 --> 00:00:48.152
A is the customer. B is the description. Then tap Next.

00:00:48.152 --> 00:00:55.560
On Details: if they gave you a PO number, type it in Customer PO#. No PO? Leave it blank.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:01:01.240
Tap Estimate Origination and pick how the job came to us, like Walk-In.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:05.048
Tap Salesperson and pick who took the sale.

00:01:05.048 --> 00:01:10.656
Tap Create Estimate. Your estimate is open and saved, with its number at the top.
